                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7e892509-cf0e-435a-bb9a-86e4e106fb3c",
                        "source_entry_id": "750b7c78-5a69-3070-b3cd-da8fe897a5d0",
                        "source_sense_id": "4a115890-141a-314e-912e-96cb0ead59c3",
                        "target_lang_word": "tufa",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tufa",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d237735b-1c5f-31ec-a0c8-4b614c943519",
                                        "entry_id": "8aa8bde1-9e60-3f15-8bd5-4836f5bd570d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Calcareous lime deposited by precipitation from a body of water, such as a hot spring."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b8c2d56-ffe3-4ac6-aeba-d380c6f20fcf",
                                                "sense_id": "d237735b-1c5f-31ec-a0c8-4b614c943519",
                                                "text": "B.J. Szabo presented the results of a survey of the tufa mounds that border Pyramid Lake indicating that uranium-series methods can be used to approximate the ages of such tufa deposits. In the Pyramid Lake Basin, tufas less than 50,000 years old contain large quantities of excess thorium, and the error in age estimates made using uranium-series methods is not small enough to confirm results from ¹⁴C determinations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6450a2d-ec11-4330-9cf1-650a49f9101a",
                                                "sense_id": "d237735b-1c5f-31ec-a0c8-4b614c943519",
                                                "text": "Resedimented tufas also contribute where erosion has washed detritus from other hillside tufa deposits."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9a9ef85-1c77-4479-880a-4096dd732881",
                                                "sense_id": "d237735b-1c5f-31ec-a0c8-4b614c943519",
                                                "text": "The tufas at Tianshengqiao have different shapes in different development stages and in different structural sections."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e634465-161c-34ed-a5e3-7726faad77dc",
                                        "entry_id": "8aa8bde1-9e60-3f15-8bd5-4836f5bd570d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A variety of volcanic rock, tuff."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a345bb00-55a5-410c-a911-8a30d70ae770",
                                                "sense_id": "6e634465-161c-34ed-a5e3-7726faad77dc",
                                                "text": "1825, \"Oliver Oldschool\" (Joseph Dennie), John Elihu Hall (editors), The Port Folio, page 426,\nThis again is followed by a bed of stony tufa of a reddish colour, containing fragments of a spongy lava, amphigone, pyroxene, mica, and common lava; and, like the former, traversed by argillaceous veins."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cbe9a307-9e6f-4ac3-a596-c7acb41fb22f",
                        "source_entry_id": "750b7c78-5a69-3070-b3cd-da8fe897a5d0",
                        "source_sense_id": "4a115890-141a-314e-912e-96cb0ead59c3",
                        "target_lang_word": "tuff",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tuff",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ede7edc2-ec08-34a7-ab6e-f793646d7c13",
                                        "entry_id": "d72f7edd-3e9d-3f22-9c84-86ca40cc1af1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A light porous rock, now especially a rock composed of compacted volcanic ash varying in size from fine sand to coarse gravel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8927f251-0f55-4b77-8c70-684d57936b08",
                                                "sense_id": "ede7edc2-ec08-34a7-ab6e-f793646d7c13",
                                                "text": "This is what makes an ignimbrite; the general term for this kind of volcaniclastic rock is ‘tuff’."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "tuff",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ab4d710-332b-3b76-b815-f3dbf428e2a0",
                                        "entry_id": "200b747e-e01d-3a3d-85de-f825df96f0fe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eye dialect spelling of tough."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "ironic",
                                            "often",
                                            "pronunciation-spelling"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ed02b19-96f0-4546-afb5-65acd506bd6a",
                                                "sense_id": "9ab4d710-332b-3b76-b815-f3dbf428e2a0",
                                                "text": "Tuff Stuff teaches that while life may go smoothly most of the time, ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b230ee90-cc2b-4efd-ac8c-beaf5d0e3d3c",
                                                "sense_id": "9ab4d710-332b-3b76-b815-f3dbf428e2a0",
                                                "text": "… yet never to make us so strong as the strongest of Men, whose Sinnews are tuffer, and Bones stronger, and Joints closer, and Flesh firmer, than ours are …"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb57c8ba-f16e-4c0d-81d8-aa509eaf4be1",
                                                "sense_id": "9ab4d710-332b-3b76-b815-f3dbf428e2a0",
                                                "text": "It was rave reviewed in the Caribbean Times as 'the ruffest, tuffest and the boo-yacka of all modern gangster novels'."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0e05e89-ef62-44dc-9391-fd67818cc6e3",
                                                "sense_id": "9ab4d710-332b-3b76-b815-f3dbf428e2a0",
                                                "text": "TUFF METER"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4be27932-ecbd-45f0-921e-26aca4625701",
                                                "sense_id": "9ab4d710-332b-3b76-b815-f3dbf428e2a0",
                                                "text": "Its Tuff-n-Tiny USB flash drive is about the size of a thumbnail. … The company insists that the \"tuff\" part of the name is well-earned for being waterproof, dustproof and you can drive a car over it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75c418ce-3147-4582-8a6c-5c8352ee17ad",
                                                "sense_id": "9ab4d710-332b-3b76-b815-f3dbf428e2a0",
                                                "text": "Tuff Stuff Professional Wrestling"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "89f31072-45c8-4b89-9e3d-28ea55ecebde",
                        "source_entry_id": "750b7c78-5a69-3070-b3cd-da8fe897a5d0",
                        "source_sense_id": "4a115890-141a-314e-912e-96cb0ead59c3",
                        "target_lang_word": "tuf",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tuf",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d8297d5-bc65-3af5-8761-d4e777539af2",
                                        "entry_id": "cab409ce-fb37-3123-ac66-a0bc0e85cf5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Roche formée par l’accumulation de petits fragments soit de roches volcaniques et de cendres, soit de calcaire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db240942-5a52-46b1-86d8-d1508c489e04",
                                                "sense_id": "7d8297d5-bc65-3af5-8761-d4e777539af2",
                                                "text": "Dix-sept îles, tufs et basaltes en amas pyramidaux ou étrangement déchiquetés, surgissent de la mer ; piliers immenses, elles supportent les brumes hautes, à moins que, monolithes gigantesques, leurs sommets ne les dominent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31584301-a75d-39cf-9fd1-ebaab9759ede",
                                        "entry_id": "cab409ce-fb37-3123-ac66-a0bc0e85cf5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pierre calcaire blanche et tendre, qui devient plus dure et plus blanche lorsqu’elle est employée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51056c2c-40bc-4f6b-9b98-9e352e024ab5",
                                                "sense_id": "31584301-a75d-39cf-9fd1-ebaab9759ede",
                                                "text": "Au IVe siècle avant J.-C., Ostie possédait toutes les caractéristiques d'un castrum, un camp militaire retranché derrière une enceinte en blocs équarris de tuf."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e00ade1-f2e0-4c54-9eb4-111d1bbbe0b3",
                                                "sense_id": "31584301-a75d-39cf-9fd1-ebaab9759ede",
                                                "text": "La plupart des maisons de la vallée de la Loire entre Blois et Saumur sont bâties en tuf."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79bf23f7-f9e0-3a74-842e-50082ddf48d8",
                                        "entry_id": "cab409ce-fb37-3123-ac66-a0bc0e85cf5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fond véritable et imparfait de quelque chose ou de quelqu’un, caché sous de belles apparences."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d588860a-8a67-4150-bd23-5ae1ac0d8bbd",
                                                "sense_id": "79bf23f7-f9e0-3a74-842e-50082ddf48d8",
                                                "text": "Le Méridional a naturellement une sorte d’éducation, il est dégrossi de naissance. Le visage est régulier, brun pâle ; on se croit, au premier instant, devant une réelle beauté profonde ; on imagine de la finesse, de l’esprit vrai, de la noblesse même. — Au bout d’un quart d’heure, le tuf se montre ; tout est à la surface en ce genre de beauté et d’esprit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8607c7dd-cbaf-436e-a8c7-12b1ccde046e",
                                                "sense_id": "79bf23f7-f9e0-3a74-842e-50082ddf48d8",
                                                "text": "Il ne voyait pas plus de raison pour que cette scélératesse fût cachée dans le tuf – inexploré d’autrui – du caractère de l’homme tendre que de l’homme froid, de l’artiste que du bourgeois, du grand seigneur que du valet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ad6a08c-a43a-4279-ad1a-13b127ad6ea2",
                                                "sense_id": "79bf23f7-f9e0-3a74-842e-50082ddf48d8",
                                                "text": "Très lettré et jusqu’au tuf, très distant et vite refermé, s’il sent chez autrui la même distance, observateur implacable des défauts, des travers et des vices : c’est une personnalité originale et âpre, qui n’a pas eu encore toute son expansion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1a2213f-8187-4283-b264-d8a752dd39c8",
                                                "sense_id": "79bf23f7-f9e0-3a74-842e-50082ddf48d8",
                                                "text": "Le rire doit donc essentiellement relever de l’instinct. Et, en effet, ses racines y plongent en plein tuf."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15e110c4-74b3-4ff3-b51b-3ef81732e38a",
                                                "sense_id": "79bf23f7-f9e0-3a74-842e-50082ddf48d8",
                                                "text": "On n’a pas besoin de l’étudier bien profondément, on a vite rencontré le tuf. (Se dit en parlant du fond de la nature de quelqu’un.)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
